    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Addresses",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Register a self-attested wallet address",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.sandbox.iron.xyz/api/addresses/crypto/attested",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "IDEMPOTENCY-KEY",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-SUB-PARTNER-ID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-API-Version",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "{{X-API-Key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Register a self-hosted wallet that the customer **declares** they control, without\nproviding a cryptographic signature. Intended for direct customers who cannot sign a\nproof-of-ownership message from their custody UI (e.g. Fireblocks).\n\nLike the signed self-hosted flow, the wallet must be registered before it can be used\nin any flow — onramp, offramp, or swap — under the **Travel Rule**. This endpoint is\ncurrently limited to customers in the **US** and **Rest of World** jurisdictions."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Register a hosted wallet address",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.sandbox.iron.xyz/api/addresses/crypto/hosted",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "IDEMPOTENCY-KEY",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-SUB-PARTNER-ID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-API-Version",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "{{X-API-Key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Register a wallet that is custodied by another VASP (e.g. Coinbase, Kraken) on behalf of the customer. This is required by the **Travel Rule** before the wallet can be used in **any** flow — onramp, offramp, or swap.\n\nProvide the VASP's DID (Decentralized Identifier) so Iron can exchange travel-rule data with the custodian. Use the [Search VASPs](#tag/Addresses/operation/searchHostedVasps) endpoint to look up the correct DID.\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Search hosted wallet providers (VASPs)",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.sandbox.iron.xyz/api/addresses/crypto/hosted/vasps",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-Version",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "q",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "query string (min 2 chars)"
              },
              {
                "name": "limit",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "optional limit (default 20, max 50)"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "{{X-API-Key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Look up a VASP by name to find its DID (Decentralized Identifier). You need the DID when registering a hosted wallet via [Register Hosted Wallet](#tag/Addresses/operation/registerHostedWallet)."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Register a self-hosted wallet address",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.sandbox.iron.xyz/api/addresses/crypto/selfhosted",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "IDEMPOTENCY-KEY",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-SUB-PARTNER-ID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-API-Version",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "{{X-API-Key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Register a wallet that the customer controls directly (i.e. they hold the private key). This is required by the **Travel Rule** before the wallet can be used in **any** flow — onramp, offramp, or swap.\n\nSubmit a proof of address ownership. **The message must be in the format**:\n\n> I am verifying ownership of the wallet address [Wallet Address] as customer [CustomerId]. This message was signed on [DD/MM/YYYY] to confirm my control over this wallet.\n\nThe signature must be generated using the priva"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get all registered wallet addresses",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.sandbox.iron.xyz/api/addresses/crypto/:customer_id",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-SUB-PARTNER-ID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-API-Version",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "customer_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "the ID of the customer"
              },
              {
                "name": "filter",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter for which type of addresses to return"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "{{X-API-Key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns every wallet address a customer has registered (linked), including both hosted and self-hosted wallets. Use the `filter` query parameter to narrow by type."
        },
